<div class="eyebrow">AJSMR POLICY</div><h1>Open Access, Copyright &amp; Licensing Policy</h1><section><h2>Open Access</h2><p>AJSMR provides open access to published scholarly content so that readers can access the scientific literature without subscription barriers.</p></section><section><h2>Copyright</h2><p>Copyright arrangements are stated in the article and applicable publication agreement. Authors should ensure that they have the necessary rights for material included in their manuscript.</p></section><section><h2>Licensing</h2><p>Where a Creative Commons licence is applied, the licence terms govern reuse of the published article and require appropriate attribution.</p></section><section><h2>Third-party Material</h2><p>Figures, tables, photographs, datasets or other third-party material may have separate rights or permissions. Authors are responsible for obtaining required permissions.</p></section><section><h2>Self-Archiving</h2><p>Authors may deposit versions of their work in accordance with the journal&#x27;s stated self-archiving and licensing terms.</p></section>
